{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55945","headline":"赞镜灯颂 · 惟劲","name":"赞镜灯颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伟哉真智士，能开方便津。\n一灯明一体，十镜现十身。\n身身相暵涉，灯灯作{牙丿=丶}因。\n层层身土广，重重理事渕。\n俨覩微尘佛，等逢毗目仙。\n海印从兹显，帝纲义由诠。\n一尘说法界，一切尘亦然。\n五藴十八界，寂用体俱全。\n圆光含镜像，一异不可宣。\n达斯无㝵境，无那法报圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"惟劲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}